in the Age of Dusk, who was known to deal with beings from other planes. In particular, he dealt with many powerful demons, until one of them, tired of his affairs, betrayed him and stole his power. In his rage, Malslek set fire to his own tower in an attempt to kill the demon. This charred hat is all that remained in the ruins.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这顶黑色的帽子曾属于一名强大的法师马斯拉克，在黄昏纪时以交游位面之广而著称。值得一提的是，他还与许多恶魔进行了交易。直到某一天，一名恶魔厌烦了契约的约束而背叛了他并偷走了马斯拉克的力量。马斯拉克一气之下烧毁了自己的高塔，意图杀死这只恶魔。最终，废墟中只剩下了这顶帽子流传至今。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d078519a064b090e5ceea25ed88652197792235b5de439c4455a6232ab087df0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6758219d78b0412bbf0f9cec60ccc6d6f584219612a345ce4db6e5b93ff6aba5","logical_entry_identity":"c8bc97d8ab654c712a0732ce4c14e965906a4572f7e03a2a13380df44b2f95e7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Explode against one target for %0.2f cold damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"自爆对单个目标造成 %0.2f 寒冷伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3bf96d3bef96a41c7be9309c9dc1d8a2cda9bfbeb64700af8db40b0884f1be1f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"675d7f0dfdc9a4b6027b17df3aa8750da1a986e3ccaf0bd0292ac1a936a30d4c","logical_entry_identity":"7a9ae441e6aadfa6775b5410b972c9f0b1c887504704c13ce4e8a70bda26f01c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"kor'pul","source_tag":"newLore category","target":"卡·普尔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7a57a0a045f1aba5c9911cd84ac7636365d388500945aafe645c6f381db5fd6f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"67661fe3204d00e26826e07d7333b1aba8adcb55a85a49c3683702fc16c8a0c3","logical_entry_identity":"d3b829c72d240e97a64ced13348a8587cf054f2063f31143f6cc0e00361cb9f2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mastery of electrokinetic forces.","source_tag":"_t","target":"掌握电能力量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"afa4eba98c98a13be3a6e1d656b02ecdc23af5775361c0a4f1ecd39bb857bd2a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"676739d10fba24ed9d153036d4ea8e89d3eab4a78e2d7c9c62bc22a8daf3ded5","lo